":"一项针对大型企业 CISO 的调查显示，36%的受访者目前愿意让 AI 智能体自主执行低风险安全操作，预计未来一年这一比例将升至60%。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FlYWDmickZ2mx411UbunyqwWa7KdyRjjicdAeKul3vzuobLm5pALKWvpMj4PubcNBe0AsEqtS7UwAOVm4Tiakn097Fa3SvdSKrEDQ4UEsML9wVM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-23T08:43:58.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzkxNzA3MTgyNg%3D%3D:2247544613:1","title":"Optimizely遭供应链攻击：178家机构网站被植入恶意代码，BBC、CNN等受影响","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNzA3MTgyNg==&mid=2247544613&idx=1&sn=764fc106602728b2e8f392755283ccd4&chksm=c0f210b4ee67e297492eb8e9364898d2fb34da2f96c59095489e3a985aa1a8d4e49edd06331d&scene=126&sessionid=1795766347#rd","description":"攻击者利用第三方数字体验平台的安全漏洞，向178家机构的网站注入恶意 JavaScript，窃取支付卡信息、Cookie，并尝试向 iPhone 和 iPad 用户投递攻击工具。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FlYWDmickZ2myHechH534rRdT6rwrmAibd3SrUv60czTsbticql1XmTqiavYiaqBic0W7ibAmUUSPoxxx1VFayuS9C9Xmib5FN9iaKC2dlyibLtanj0Eg4%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzkxNzA3MTgyNg%3D%3D:2247544605:1","title":"Corma融资1.25亿美元，估值达10亿美元，打造网络安全防御专用 AI 基础模型","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNzA3MTgyNg==&mid=2247544605&idx=1&sn=7a0ddce7168c805f71ada2398a9bdebb&chksm=c03bfe4c2d7b22e3f7e8fbdc676917ec77a571812073db4aff64ad66bc80dc06b2a544e668d2&scene=126&sessionid=1795766347#rd","description":"网络安全初创公司 Corma 宣布完成 1.25 亿美元 A 轮融资，累计融资达到 1.85 亿美元，公司估值达到 10 亿美元。新资金将用于扩大 AI 基础模型训练规模、增加计算资源，并加快面向企业安全运营的 AI 智能体开发。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FlYWDmickZ2mx5ntQZia2n0R9APfIzc2WJJ1481PLZmCew3QeGzqZtbWu9Micr3YPxruJibicWalOIOKNhR4fsEe7ianRLiaB5c5hIYftOoT99atBSY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-19T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzkxNzA3MTgyNg%3D%3D:2247544605:2","title":"从分散告警到攻击链还原：图数据库在SOC中的落地实践","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.